# Project Requirements

## Business Requirements

We want a scientific calculator that includes:
-Basic arithmetic
-Trigonometry functions including calcuations of sine, cosine, tangent, and their inverse functions
-Logorithms (base 10) and natural logortithms (base e)
-Exonponents and roots (calculates squares, cubes, roots, powers)
-Constants and Pi (include dedicated dkeys for mathematical constant like pi an e)

## User Requirements

-The user will expect a visual button interface to perform addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, and also an equals operand to compute totals. 
-The user will be able compute exponents and mathematical operations within parentheses.
-The software should remain visually consistent, no flashing or refreshing upon button press.
-The visual theme should incorporate the elements of The Rocky Horror Picture Show

## Software Requirements
-Python 3
-Python Flask
-NO javascript
-HTML/CSS
-Include an .md file that traces your development steps for reproducibility 